{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncanny Tales</strong> is an episodic horror game where the scariest things aren\u2019t monsters or the supernatural \u2014 they\u2019re people themselves. Each story is a new chilling episode, inspired by real-life fears and disturbing situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686940/extras/400fe55f7b7140591df86901761d1124.poster.avif?t=1757511236\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686940/extras/400fe55f7b7140591df86901761d1124.webm?t=1757511236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686940/extras/400fe55f7b7140591df86901761d1124.mp4?t=1757511236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncanny Tales: 1992 \u2014 Episode Two</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anton, a 14-year-old teenager, moves with his parents to a small provincial town. There's no time to settle in \u2014 his parents leave on business, leaving him alone in his grandmother's old apartment.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, a true nightmare unfolds in the town. Over the past few months, more than ten children have gone missing. Schools are closed, streets are deserted, and the police are powerless. People are afraid to let their children outside, but the disappearances continue...\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersed in the unsettling silence of an unfamiliar home and empty streets, Anton begins to notice oddities. Rustling behind the walls, someone's gaze from the darkness, random encounters that only heighten the fear. Something is brewing in this town \u2014 and it's no longer clear who is a friend and who is the true evil.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Interaction with Characters</strong><br>Engage in dialogues, observe the behavior of those around you, and gather pieces of information.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Environment</strong><br>Almost every item can be examined, rotated, or used \u2014 stay attentive.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere of Growing Suspense</strong><br>Gradual tension, anxiety, and the feeling that you're not alone \u2014 even when no one is around.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>USSR, Autumn 1992</strong><br>Meticulously recreated post-Soviet era life \u2014 from interiors to the gloom of the streets.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oppressive Atmosphere</strong><br>Not just frightening \u2014 it gets under your skin. Fear grows slowly and doesn't let go.\u200b</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New home","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/ca746b2d18f84b617199d513a35d6a53233facf9.jpg"},{"name":"Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/b5361e0cee8bb563ceb3c97fac698979856e3d6c.jpg"},{"name":"Scheduled radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/794be50bd82fae422d4e63fcb3641375922c10d5.jpg"},{"name":"The scary truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/b790309c1d61a245f77361ef7c82664555af8748.jpg"},{"name":"It's time to learn how to tie shoelaces.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/8ae7fba66cf1e10af2b198a2628f1ff93300f203.jpg"},{"name":"The final","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3686940/1d4be380bae7b319174f60d2998e66cc23b5938e.jpg"},{"name":" The missing boy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st